  "under_voice_reason": "Playing one clip's own sound under or after your voice only works in a voiceover edit made on your iPhone, not in this one",
  "review_null_zu_null": "Couldn't: das 0:0-Foto bei 'Null zu null' (I never heard Null zu null in your voice)"
 },
